@context: IF / ELSE, WHILE, REPEAT and FOR EACH — a body is the indented lines under a header ending in ':'.
@title: control_flow

@var: {site} = http://localhost:8000
@var: {wanted} = Manul Plush, Snow Boots

STEP 1: IF — branch on the page or on a variable
    NAVIGATE to {site}/login.html
    FILL 'Username' field with 'grace'
    FILL 'Password' field with 'hopper'
    CLICK the 'Sign in' button
    EXTRACT the 'Role' into {role}
    IF {role} == 'admin':
        PRINT "full access"
    ELIF {role} contains 'member':
        PRINT "member access"
    ELSE:
        PRINT "no idea who this is"
    IF button 'Delete everything' exists:
        PRINT "this never prints"

STEP 2: WHILE — repeat until the page changes
    NAVIGATE to {site}/dynamic.html
    WHILE button 'Load more' exists:
        CLICK the 'Load more' button
    VERIFY that 'Feed item 6' is present

STEP 3: REPEAT — a fixed number of times
    NAVIGATE to {site}/shop.html
    REPEAT 3 TIMES as {n}:
        CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR 'Steppe Map'
        PRINT "added map number {n}"
    VERIFY that 'Cart: 3' is present

STEP 4: FOR EACH — over a comma-separated list
    FOR EACH {item} IN {wanted}:
        CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR '{item}'
    VERIFY that 'Cart: 5' is present

DONE.
